---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import LoopSummary from '../components/LoopSummary.astro';
import Lightbox from '../components/Lightbox.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Jackie B III — Going Loopy"
  description="About Jackie B III, the crew, and the Great Loop voyage from 2022 to 2024."
>
  <div class="max-w-[720px] mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <h1 class="font-inter font-bold text-[28px] text-ink leading-[1.2] mb-8">About Jackie B III</h1>

    <LoopSummary />

    <div class="font-lora text-[18px] text-ink leading-[1.7]">
      <p class="mb-6">
        Jackie B III is a powerboat that completed the Great Loop — a 6,273.4-nautical-mile continuous waterway
        circuit through the eastern United States, Canada, and the Gulf of Mexico — from 22 April 2022 through
        17 May 2024: 679 hours underway across 234 boat movements, averaging 9.2 knots. This site is the
        permanent record of that voyage, documented stop by stop along the way.
      </p>

      <p class="mb-6">
        The Great Loop follows a connected system of rivers, lakes, canals, and coastal waterways: up the
        Atlantic Intracoastal Waterway, through the Great Lakes, down the Mississippi and Tennessee-Tombigbee
        waterways, across the Gulf of Mexico, around Florida, and back up the East Coast to the starting point
        in New Bern, NC. Every anchorage, every marina, every town along the way is documented here.
      </p>

      <p class="mb-6">
        This site was built to share the voyage with family and friends who followed along, and with the
        broader Great Loop community. The trip is complete — but the stories are still being published.
      </p>
    </div>

    <h2 class="font-inter font-bold text-[22px] text-ink leading-[1.3] mt-12 mb-6">Meet the Crew</h2>

    <div class="font-lora text-[18px] text-ink leading-[1.7]">
      <p class="mb-6">
        This July we will celebrate our 40th wedding anniversary. God has blessed us with each other and a
        wonderful life. Our story began at West Point when Mike was a cadet. He asked where I was from which
        prompted him to tell his absolute favorite story of his trip with high school buddies Ralph, Scott, Jeff,
        and John down the Mississippi up the Illinois Rivers and up Lake Michigan on Ralph's father's 40 foot
        Chris Craft to Mackinaw Island. There he joined Ralph's grandparents as crew on their 60 foot Chris Craft
        to the North Channel. I of course was entranced and followed up with a lot of questions since I had also
        cruised the North Channel as a babysitter on a 40 foot sailboat. I firmly believe this common experience
        was the fertile ground in which we would grow our relationship and lead us to eventually make this bucket
        list journey to explore together the north channel on our American Great Loop tour. We have three
        children and 5 grandchildren. I retired from teaching in October of 2020 and Mike retired from the Army
        in 2003 and from his second career as a senior executive in the Department of Defense in July of 2021.
        Mike is the Captain and videographer and I am the first mate and blogger&#128522;
      </p>
    </div>

    <figure class="about-photo mb-10">
      <img
        class="zoomable-img"
        src="https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjyMkTwZ7A5L5rXSGtJvY9hL8j_cvNf-cB3ZnSuYz4vH6YmZocyvZpGftk6kjRmo6qy20BGB7hGm6EL2d7N4Si-T1WYSr4W4QQUpsNKruI4pqI9CliSL9LunTT7siUtOBeliKzi5u3oqwdo3k92oQq9vdOC_KIZ1zwJw5wZWF7TjQKZTdAHGA0KIlww/s960/6C7CF4D2-5BD7-4695-B74E-E07242667F64.jpeg"
        alt="Mike and Barbara"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
    </figure>

    <h2 class="font-inter font-bold text-[22px] text-ink leading-[1.3] mb-6">More Background</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <a
        href="/our-boat/"
        class="block bg-navy rounded-lg px-6 py-8 no-underline hover:bg-[#233d61] focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brass focus-visible:outline-none transition-colors"
      >
        <h3 class="font-inter font-bold text-[20px] text-brass mb-2">Our Boat</h3>
        <p class="font-inter text-[14px] text-muted">The story behind the Jackie B III.</p>
      </a>
      <a
        href="/new-bern/"
        class="block bg-navy rounded-lg px-6 py-8 no-underline hover:bg-[#233d61] focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brass focus-visible:outline-none transition-colors"
      >
        <h3 class="font-inter font-bold text-[20px] text-brass mb-2">New Bern, NC</h3>
        <p class="font-inter text-[14px] text-muted">Our home port and winter home.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <Lightbox />
</Layout>

<style>
  .about-photo {
    border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    border-radius: 8px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .about-photo img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }
</style>
